<title>MEXICO: Cydsa unit opens $10 mln plant in Mexico.</title>
<headline>Cydsa unit opens $10 mln plant in Mexico.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cydsa unit Industria Quimica del Istmo opened a $10 million plant in the central state of Tlaxcala, employing 50 people, the parent company said in a statement on Sunday.</p>
<p>It said the plant would produce sodium hypochloride for the whitener industry.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560</p>
